From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jacob McSwain <jacob@mcswain.dev>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:27:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gateway): gateway.stop_trace writes a stop's timing
 trace

gateway.stop_trace (false = off): from the stop signal or restart request until shortly after the profile is released, a sampler thread writes $HERMES_HOME/stop-trace/<pid>.log with the stop path's phase marks and, every 100 ms when it changed, what each asyncio task awaits and what each thread runs. For diagnosing a slow stop without the gateway log.
